<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112178" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορύσσω</span></b> , 
			Act.
		 only in aor.
		part. and inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορύξας, -αι</span> (v.infr.):— 
			Med.
		, aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφορύξατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					203
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, pres.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορύσσεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					5.269
				</span></i>
			; pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεφόρυγμαι</span> (v.
				infr.):—<i>defile,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορύξας αἵματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					18.336
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδατι φορύξαι</span>”
				<i>mix up,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.74
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλιτι ἑφθῷ φορύξαντα καὶ φυρήσαντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Steril.</u>
					221
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>VM</u>
				3
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεφορυγμένον ἰῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					302
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				12.550
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					1.381
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύθροιο φορύσσεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>H.</u>
					5.269
				</span></i>
			.</div>
